<p>Minimalist interiors are often the most cost-efficient style per sq ft precisely because there's less applied detail — but resist the temptation to under-budget storage, which is the one area worth spending more, not less.</p>
<h2>Minimalist vs Other Popular Styles</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
